    },
    {
      "id": 510441827,
      "url": "https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/3717#issuecomment-510441827",
      "body": "The onboarding card was approved by legal.  The issue is that the data collection settings should be updated to reflect the same language in the privacy notice - that Usage and technical data is collected by default. Note that the label for the section is Data collection (not choices) and the telemetry collection is called Usage and technical data\r\n\r\n<img width=\"342\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-07-11 at 7 07 14 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20115914/61046281-bcdeda00-a3aa-11e9-94e2-29ec9f097b33.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"395\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-07-11 at 7 06 36 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20115914/61046289-c1a38e00-a3aa-11e9-9cb9-05a5092de832.png\">\r\n",
